# For notes, manifest vhosts wins. This snippet also declares 'notes'
# and a 'legacy' — the manifest set should MASK the caddy fallback so
# 'legacy' does NOT appear in the discovered set (deduplicated) but
# 'notes' remains sourced from manifest.
http://notes.{$DOMAIN} { reverse_proxy silverbullet:3000 }
http://legacy.{$DOMAIN} { reverse_proxy silverbullet:3000 }
